          "role": "Customer",
          "inbound": true,
          "created_at": "Wed Nov 01 13:23:37 +0000 2017",
          "text": "@Delta Thank you very much! Would a laptop bag (i.e. a bag holding only my laptop) also count as a personal item, or would that be a carry on?"
